# @worksgood/__PKG_SUFFIX__

Prebuilt [WorksGood](https://github.com/graphwork/wg) binaries for `__TARGET__`:
`worksgood`, `wg`, and `nex` at version `__WG_VERSION__`.

You probably do not want to install this package directly — it is installed
automatically as an optional dependency of [`@worksgood/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@worksgood/cli),
which provides the `wg` / `nex` / `worksgood` commands.

- The binaries in this package are exactly the release artifacts from the
  matching GitHub release (`wg-v__WG_VERSION____ARCHIVE_SUFFIX__`). On macOS
  they currently ship **unsigned and un-notarized** (Apple Developer ID
  secrets are not configured), so Gatekeeper may block the first run;
  allow it with `xattr -d com.apple.quarantine "$(which wg)"` or
  right-click → Open.
- Verify the release: `gh attestation verify wg-v__WG_VERSION____ARCHIVE_SUFFIX__.tar.gz --repo graphwork/wg`
- npm additionally enforces SHA-512 integrity on the package tarball itself.
